message: "If you use this repository, please cite both it and the paper below."
title: "OpenClaw: WhatsApp-Native Agentic LLM Orchestration for Multi-Domain Small-Business Operations"
abstract: >
  OpenClaw is a WhatsApp-native agentic LLM orchestration system deployed across
  three Indian SMB production instances. It treats WhatsApp as the primary operating
  interface, layering persistent memory (Mem0), semantic search (Qdrant), and local
  inference (Ollama) to enable multi-domain business automation without proprietary
  SaaS platforms. This companion repository contains the sanitized reference
  architecture and non-sensitive configuration patterns described in the paper.
